      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Hard to knock the recent consistency of BLACKJACK SAM (3) who continued a run of top-two results when he led to score by 5m last week, adding to a strong record at this circuit and distance. Expect him to go forward again from another low draw. That will see him hard to catch. EXIT ELEVEN (5) is really delivering now having come from a wider barrier and dug deep to get home by a neck last week, giving him three wins and a second from his last four outings. He can make an impact again as can AIR FORCE MAJOR (1) who has 9m to make up on BLACKJACK SAM through the last-start placing but he gets the ace draw and came from there for a Redcliffe win prior. SCAR STRUCK (10) may need luck from his second row draw but has been good in two starts at this circuit and distance since a spell, winning fresh before chasing BLACKJACK SAM as runner-up last week.",
